+    c. Compute the cosine weight $(n \cdot l_i)^+$, where $(x)^+ = \max(0, x)$.
+    d. Add the product $v(p, l_i) (n \cdot l_i)^+$ to the accumulator.
+3.  Divide the accumulator by $N$ to obtain the final average.
 
